SUMMARY:Project C.O.P.E.
DESCRIPTION:Project C.O.P.E.\nChallenging Outdoor Personal Experience\nC.O
 .P.E. is an acronym for Challenging Outdoor Personal Experience and at Ma
 taguay Scout Ranch\, we have a weekend that will do just that!\nWhether y
 our unit needs help learning how to Communicate\, Plan\, Trust each other
 \, Team-work\, build Leadership\, learn to Make Decisions\, Problem Solve
 \, or just build Self-esteem\, we have a program that will fill your unit
 s needs.\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.org/events/cope-weekend-2026-7
