UID:fall-family-fun@sdicscouting.org
DTSTAMP:20261023T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:Fall Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Fall Family Fun\nSave the Date\nScouts and their families are 
 invited to join us for a fall-themed weekend getaway to relax and enjoy t
 he outdoors.\nCost:\n$30 (per youth 6- 17 yrs ) $15 (adult)\nSiblings 2yr
 s-5yrs $10\, Children under 2yrs NO CHARGE\nSaturday only price $15 age 6
  and up\nThis event is for Scouts and their families. All Scouts are welc
 ome\n!\nActivities:\nArchery\, BB's\, the lakefront is open for fishing (
 bring your own gear)\, hiking\, bring your bike and helmet (mountain bike
  tires recommended)\,  nature\, crafts & games\,\nCheck-in:\n4-8 pm Frid
 ay at Silva Lodge Patio\n(SATURDAY check-in 7:30-8:30 am) Shooting safety
  brief at 8:45am is mandatory for those who want to shoot.\nCheck out:\n8
 :30-11 am Sunday\nWhat to Bring:\nCompleted BSA Health form Part A & B fo
 r EVERY participant (adult and youth) tent\, sleeping bag\, sleeping mat\
 , clothing for warm and cold weather\, hat\, toiletries\, sunscreen\, wat
 er\, snacks\, chair\, flashlight\, and a sense of adventure!\nPlease brin
 g all the food and cooking equipment for your family to use at the campsi
 te.\nWhat NOT to Bring\n:  Weapons (toy or real)\, pets\, skateboards\, 
 electronics\, or alcoholic beverages.  NO OPEN-TOED SHOES OR SANDALS. Se
 rvice animals are the only animals allowed and they must be documented.\n
 Contact: Program Director\nJohnathon Hall -\nJohnathon.Hall@scouting.org\
 nFamilies must pre-register. WALK-IN'S cannot be guaranteed space\nFamily
  Camp will not be providing a Dining Hall meal option.  Please bring all
  the food and cooking equipment for your family to use at the campsite.\n
 \nhttps://www.sdicscouting.org/events/fall-family-fun
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/fall-family-fun
LOCATION:Mataguay Scout Ranch\, Mataguay Rd\, Santa Ysabel\, CA 92070
END:VEVENT
