BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cub-scout-lock-in@sdicscouting.org
DTSTAMP:20261121T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
SUMMARY:Cub Scout Lock-in
DESCRIPTION:Cub Scout Lock-in\nSave the Date\nCub Scout Sea World Lock-In\
 nScouting for adventure? A SeaWorld overnight outing provides fun and adv
 enture while exploring nature up close. Plus\, you get to sleep next to a
 mazing ocean animals. Sleepovers for Scouts are available throughout the 
 year\, and includes a full day of SeaWorld shows\, rides and animal attra
 ctions the day after your sleepover.\nDATE\n: November 21\, 2026\n‍\nAR
 RIVAL\n: 5:45 PM\nPlease arrive on time\, entrance doors will close as so
 on as check-in is completed\, and no one will be admitted after 6:00 PM.\
 nCOST\n:\n$200 per Person\n(Scout or Adult)\n$165 per pass member\n(Pass 
 Holder status will be checked upon entrance to the event. Must hold curre
 nt Member Pass to receive this price.)\nMINIMUM AGE:\n7 years old\nA mini
 mum of 2 adult leaders must accompany a unit/den to the Lock-In\, and uni
 ts must maintain a 4:1 ratio of youth to adults.\nIndividual scouts(s) wi
 th parent/guardian registration must still meet the 4:1 ratio.\nAll youth
  attendees must be registered members of Cub Scouts.\nLOCK-IN INCLUDES\n:
 \nPasta dinner\nFun and educational activities\nBreakfast\nSeaWorld Sleep
 over T-shirt\nSeaWorld patch\nSeaWorld admission the day after your Sleep
 over\nMEALS\nPre-planned dinner and breakfast are included in the event p
 rice. Please document any special dietary needs or allergies to be sent t
 o SeaWorld staff so they can make accommodations as needed.\n\nhttps://ww
 w.sdicscouting.org/events/cub-scout-lock-in
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/cub-scout-lock-in
LOCATION:Sea World San Diego\, 500 Sea World Dr.\, San Diego\, CA 92109
END:VEVENT
