 ective:\nComplete the projects listed below to allow for a better experie
 nce for the scouts and families who come to Mataguay Scout Ranch.\nWhy:\n
 Help revitalize Mataguay Scout Camp for the Scouts!\nDetails:\nFor those 
 who wish to spend the night a Casita will be opened\, this is a spot to s
 pend the night and take a hot shower. Food will not be provided by the co
 uncil.\nWhat to Bring:\nFilled out med forms parts A and B\nWater bottle\
 , proper clothing/work clothing\, gloves\nIf spending the night: Food\, c
 amping equipment\, and proper clothing\nTools if you believe they will be
