 d Road)\nCost:\n$30 for Youth\n$15 for Adults\nLunch is NOT included. You
  may bring a sack lunch.\n‍\nCheck-in opens at 9:45 am\nExperience the 
 great outdoors and enjoy the day at the Youth Aquatic Center.  We will h
 ave staff to assist you with all activities and oversee the waterfront.\n
 ‍\nFamilies must pre-register. NO WALK-IN'S.\nPlease no dogs allowed at
