DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270220
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270222
SUMMARY:HALTT Session III
DESCRIPTION:HALTT Session III\nThis 40-hour course prepares unit leaders f
 or backpacking trips.\nThis 40-hour course prepares unit leaders for basi
 c backpacking and wilderness camping trips. Topics include: leadership\, 
 trek planning\, equipment\, food\, health and safety\, map and compass\, 
 awards\, and conservation. Leaders completing sessions I\, II\, and III r
 eceive a patch and numbered card.\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.org/events/
 haltt-session-3-feb-2027
