DESCRIPTION:Mataguay Scout Ranch Work Party\nCabin - Remodel\nParticipants
 :\nScouts (ages 14 and up with parent)\nVenturers\nAdult leaders and volu
 nteers\n(Scouts under 14 will have age appropriate jobs if present)\nProj
 ect Focus:\nConstruction and maintenance projects aimed at enhancing camp
  facilities for Summer Camp & Weekend Programs. Projects will range from 
 small repairs to larger construction tasks.\nProject Objective:\nComplete
  the projects listed below to allow for a better experience for the scout
 s and families who come to Mataguay Scout Ranch.\nWhy:\nHelp revitalize M
 ataguay Scout Camp for the Scouts!\nDetails:\nFor those who wish to spend
